@startuml Kelola_Pesanan_Admin
!theme plain
title SD: Kelola Pesanan (Admin)
actor Admin
participant "App (Flutter)" as App
participant "Backend" as API
database "Database" as DB

Admin -> App: Buka Kelola Pesanan
App -> API: GET /orders
API -> DB: SELECT orders + items + customer_name + notes
DB --> API: List pesanan
API --> App: JSON pesanan
App --> Admin: Tampil daftar pesanan\n(ID, pelanggan, total, status, catatan customer)

Admin -> App: Pilih status baru dari dropdown\n(Diproses → Dikirim → Selesai)
App -> API: PUT /orders/status/{id}\n{status}
API -> DB: UPDATE orders SET status
DB --> API: Success

note over API: Jika status = "Selesai":
API -> DB: Catat rental aktif (jika ada item Sewa)
API -> DB: Hitung & beri voucher reward ke customer
API -> API: Kirim FCM push notifikasi ke Customer

API --> App: 200 OK
App --> Admin: "Status berhasil diupdate"

@enduml
